  title="New from W.W. Wood: Radius End Panels and Radius Columns"
  description="W.W. Wood's new Radius End Panel and full lineup of Radius Columns bring a softened, furniture-style curve to wall, base, vanity, utility, and peninsula applications. A look at the sample construction and where to use it."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-09-04"
  ogImage="/images/blog/radius-end-panel-columns/listing-card.webp"
